        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Apam ajiuna gan lou the,",
            "Nangpui huainei mei mu ri o;",
            "Hei lat kang hei ai khat sini,",
            "Mu thui lak ge apui latkang.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Apui ram jian makum pukhou,",
            "Tauni kamei ring bam kumme;",
            "Mpuan aliu rih-ri guang khou,",
            "Apui neimei tei ning tou e.",
            "",
            "2. Ai mu thui lak apui khuan ta,",
            "Kakhuan #!7 alung ti kabiu;",
            "Aram rianra Raguang thai lou,",
            "Apui manmei makum bam khou.",
            "",
            "3. Tingkum guan sini mu thui lak,",
            "Jianmei lat #!7 ncham lou mei;",
            "Aram rianra Raguang #!7 thai,",
            "Apui neimei makum pukhou."
          ]
        }
      },
